{"id":"ursache","lemma":"Ursache","pos":"noun","rank":1944,"glosses":["cause (source or reason of an event or action)"],"ipa":"/ˈuːɐ̯ˌzaxə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/93/De-Ursache.ogg/De-Ursache.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Ursache","plural":"Ursachen"},"examples":[{"text":"„Danke für die Hilfe.“ – „Keine Ursache.“","en":"\"Thanks for the help.\" \"Don't mention it.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/673440","words":[{"g":"thanks, thank you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"the act of helping"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Wir können die Ursache nicht finden.","en":"We can't find the cause.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to find"}]},{"text":"Epilepsie kann verschiedene Ursachen haben.","en":"Epilepsy can have various causes.","words":[{"g":"epilepsy"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"different","l":"verschieden"},null,{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Wissen Sie, was die Ursache dafür ist?","en":"Do you know what caused this?","words":[{"g":"to know"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"for that, for it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Woher willst du wissen, daß das die Ursache war?","en":"How do you know that was the cause?","words":[{"g":"where from, whence"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"}]}]}